; Only the activation entry, with no data. Every condition that reads a
; factor is undefined, and none selects a THEN branch: the IF chain ends in
; ELSE buyer MAY cancel, not exercised, and the last IF, which has no ELSE,
; completes at once. Both are runs of one entry with outcome Done.
; DEFAULT(discount, 0) is 0 without discount, so the WHEN condition is false,
; not undefined, and the WHEN term completes at once too.
(scenario conditional_undefined
  (spec "examples/core/core_conditional.triel")
  (entry "2026-06-01T00:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data)))
